(
    title: "Open Sesame",
    description: Some("As Ali Baba you scale a treasure hill floor by floor, throwing out two ropes on each storey to open a way up while guards patrol after you; lingering high on a rope keeps you out of their reach. Catching the magic ball briefly turns your touch deadly, freezing guards into golden statues, and a 5,000-point time bonus drains as you climb toward the treasury. One of only two Atari 2600 games with synthesised speech; in the US it shipped re-themed by ZiMAG as I Want My Mommy, with Teddy the bear riding teleporter beams up a six-storey tower in place of Ali Baba\'s ropes."),
